-- a measured constant as the record states it, with nothing asserted beyond the measurement: the
-- decimal digits of the value, how many of them precede the decimal point, and the standard
-- uncertainty in units of the last digit — CODATA's own notation, 137.035999177(21). No real number
-- is formed; the bound is what is known.
CodataValue : Type 0
CodataValue = (digits : List Nat) × (point : Nat) × List Nat
